  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nAfter having switched from your Home World to a different World the Here Tab in the Quick Menu will still show the old Instance information. This only happens if you haven't opened the Here Tab in your Home World though.   \n\nSwitching to a different Tab and back refreshes it / results in it showing the correct information.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**  \n\n1. Launch VRChat\n\n2. Do **not** open the Here Tab in your Home World (if you do the error wont occur)\n\n3. Switch to a different World  \n\n4. Open Here Tab\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe Here Tab should refresh automatically and not display old information.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/yxrudb.mp4",
